              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are given an array of Kanban card objects:\n\n {{$context.$variables.kanbanCardDetails}} \n\nEach object in this array represents one Kanban card for the same Item.\n- Generate a Pie chart displaying the count for each card status.\n- Generate a multi record widget displaying the card statuses and other information."
            }
